# New in the ghackett fork of agent-session-manager (GPL-3.0).
# The source distribution carries the conformance kit (conformance/, MIT: a
# server author's tool, see its README); the wheel does not (pyproject.toml's
# packages.find takes collins* alone). scripts/verify_wheel_data.py checks.
graft conformance
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod]
